# Sprint Lease Anatomy (no babysitting)

## Standing grant (this rule IS the lease)

On every Dema-clean session, without waiting for SPARC paste walls:

1. **Rebind** — `git status -sb`, HEAD, dirty paths. Disk beats transcript.
2. **One SNR slice** — highest-value, lowest-noise, reversible, testable. Reject the rest in one line.
3. **Do it** — implement + focused tests. Do not ask for GO on ordinary in-scope edits.
4. **Prove** — run the narrowest test command; report exit codes.
5. **Close** — what shipped · what’s blocked · one next slice. Stop.

## Auto-GO (inside lease)

- Edit / add tests / run focused tests / update matching docs for the slice
- Commit when the user said commit, or when they said “sprint” / “keep going” / “carry me” for that slice’s green proof
- Leave unrelated dirty trees untouched

## Still halt (fresh typed GO only)

Push · merge · force · delete branches · keys/DID · mint · deploy · secrets · foreign-repo edits · Drive bulk move · live model/daemon start

## Forbidden noise

- Re-paste SPARC / Peak / Singularity / HHMM / full PDF dumps as the work itself
- Multi-agent theater without a bounded slice
- Claiming Node0-closed / RSI-live / federation
- Full `npm test` when focused suite answers; note OUTWARD blockers honestly (e.g. COVERAGE-COUNTS)

## Definition of healthy (DoD for “I can rest”)

A day is healthy when all are true:

- [ ] No false-GREEN on release-readiness (score teeth + CLI exit) — **shipped**
- [ ] Dirty PEAK-ZERO-SPIN either committed or explicitly parked
- [ ] Focused gates green for the active slice
- [ ] One outsider-usable loop documented (first-run truth) — **open**
- [ ] Map-before-merge for Downloads/absorption — **open**, no silent ingest
- [ ] `authority_delta = 0` unless operator widened it

## Wake phrase (user)

Say only: `SPRINT` or `carry the lease`  
Agent continues the board below. No wall required.

